WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.955
System one is fast and intuitive, about ninety-five percent of our thinking.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:08.516
System two is slow and logical, only five percent.

00:00:08.566 --> 00:00:11.122
Brands work as mental shortcuts.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:15.722
In the drinks aisle, nobody weighs every can on sugar and price.

00:00:15.772 --> 00:00:19.167
System one just reaches for the familiar red one.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:22.765
That's why emotional advertising works best.

00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:27.081
People buy on intuition, then post-rationalise with the facts.

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:28.991
Use it like this:

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:30.877
aim brand building at system one,

00:00:30.927 --> 00:00:31.774
with familiar,

00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:35.117
distinctive cues that make choosing effortless.
